{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>The phrase ויקחו לי.</b> Like the form סורה אלי (Judges 4:18) — that he turn aside from his place and draw near to him; so too here, that one take from him and give to Me. Likewise קחי נא לי מעט מים (1 Kings 17:10)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:08.225165756Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}